{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34023","headline":"詶鲁望见迎绿罽次韵 · 皮日休","name":"詶鲁望见迎绿罽次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻裁鸭绿任金刀，不怕西风断野蒿。\n詶赠既无青玉案，纤华犹欠赤霜袍。\n烟披怪石难同逸，竹映仙禽未胜高。\n成後料君无别事，只应酣饮咏离骚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}